o process is a black hole or a miracle: each has at least one input and one output.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;margin:4px 0;'&gt;&amp;#10003;&amp;nbsp; Every data store is written by at least one process and read by at least one process.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;margin:4px 0;'&gt;&amp;#10003;&amp;nbsp; No flow runs directly between two data stores or between an entity and a data store.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;margin:4px 0;'&gt;&amp;#10003;&amp;nbsp; Processes are named as verb phrases; data flows are named as noun phrases.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;margin:4px 0;'&gt;&amp;#10003;&amp;nbsp; The single &lt;i&gt;External Service Provider&lt;/i&gt; actor of the use case diagram is realised by three service entities.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillStyle=solid;strokeColor=#1e1e1e;fontColor=#1e1e1e;text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ebfbee;strokeColor=#2f9e44;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1330" width="1220" height="188" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="2.2 Context Diagram (Level 0)" id="l0"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2240" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="l0-v1" value="&lt;b&gt;BonVoyage: Context Diagram (Level 0 DFD)&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillStyle=solid;strokeColor=#1e1e1e;fontColor=#1e1e1e;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontS